<title>USA: Fargo, N.D., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Fargo, N.D., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Saving Bank said it won $7.770 mil lion of Fargo, N.D., refunding improvement bonds of 1996, Series C, with a true interest cost of 5.0492 percent.</p>
</text>
